# Requests for VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio / Rider against a local Development run
# (docker compose up, or dotnet run with SQL Server on localhost). Dev auth reads the X-Dev-* headers.

@api = http://localhost:5080

### Admin opens tomorrow's slots (change the date)
POST {{api}}/admin/slots
X-Dev-User: admin-1
X-Dev-Roles: Admin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": 1, "serviceTypeId": 1, "date": "2030-03-02", "opens": "08:00:00", "closes": "12:00:00", "capacityPerSlot": 3 }

### Citizen looks for a slot
GET {{api}}/branches/1/slots?serviceTypeId=1&date=2030-03-02
X-Dev-User: citizen-1

### Citizen books it
POST {{api}}/appointments
X-Dev-User: citizen-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slotId": 1 }

### Citizen's appointments
GET {{api}}/appointments/mine
X-Dev-User: citizen-1

### Counter queue for the day
GET {{api}}/branches/1/queue?date=2030-03-02
X-Dev-User: staff-1
X-Dev-Roles: Staff
